sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant API
    participant Cache
    participant Database
    Browser->>API: GET /catalog
    API->>Cache: Read catalog
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>API: Cached catalog
    else Cache miss
        Cache-->>API: Not found
        API->>Database: Query catalog
        Database-->>API: Catalog rows
        API->>Cache: Store catalog
    end
    API-->>Browser: 200 OK + catalog
